# Personal collection data in the clear.
#
# The repository is public and git history is append-only, so anything committed
# here is public forever — including after Phase 5 encrypts the served copies.
# Migration inputs and decrypted working copies live here and are never committed.
.local/

# Per-run reports written by the daily job. They exist only to be read by the workflow
# step that follows them; one left in the tree makes that step fire on every run.
.frozen-prices.md
.stale-prices.md
.resolution-report.md
